    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "which follows since $ \\sum \\alpha_k q_k = \\sum \\delta_{jk} q_k = 0 $ (Chapter 4). The expected value for the marker contrast from this sire becomes",
      "source_page": 511,
