    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Thus, assuming a single QTL linked to the marker, the expected marker contrast for a given sire is the difference of the average effects of his alleles at this QTL, scaled by the QTL-marker recombination frequency.",
      "source_page": 511,
      "printed_page": 491,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter16:p007:b8"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        80.0,
        696.0,
